AMIX: public-key arithmetic on the Z3660's ARM core 1 (zzcrypto)

X25519, Ed25519, prime-curve point multiplication and modular exponentiation
go to core 1 when it runs a program with zzcrypto (z3660ARM_Core_amix); the
060's code runs otherwise.  crypto/zzc.c is the 060's side, the protocol is
include/crypto/zzcrypto.h (amix-gate firmware/core1/zzcrypto).  Built with
-DOPENSSL_ZZ3660 only.

